  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open up the instance you want to join in your VRChat menu.\n\n2. Make sure it says \"Selected Instance\" at the top.\n\n3. Click on Join and get notified that the instance is full.\n\n4. Continue to click on join and then OK on the error popup, hoping to be able to join when space opens up.\n\n5. Realize that even though the number has dropped significantly below the cap, you still can't join.",
